WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.567
-Our next guest earned
two Grammy nominations

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:06.167
for Best Folk Album and
Best American Roots Performance.

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:08.033
Performing
"Life According to Raechel"

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:11.801
from her album "Revealer,"
here's Madison Cunningham.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:15.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.367
-♪ Once your girl ♪

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:22.767
♪ I'm always your girl ♪

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:25.834
♪ When I'm here
or when I'm there ♪

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:30.734
♪ Or on a plane
headed somewhere ♪

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:34.267
♪ You were staring
down the cars ♪

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.434
♪ Hoping it would be
one of ours ♪

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:44.434
♪ Children and grandchildren
writing you cards ♪

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:49.701
♪ But how long
were you waiting for me ♪

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:58.467
♪ To make a left
down your street? ♪

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:06.434
♪ It's not if, darling,
it's when ♪

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:14.467
♪ Was there something
left unsaid? ♪

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:18.834
♪ Were your eyes green? ♪

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:22.300
♪ Were they blue? ♪

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:29.033
♪ What was it that I forgot
to ask you? ♪

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:38.234
♪ Busy hands,
I'll set 'em down ♪

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:45.000
♪ To say I love you
right out loud ♪

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:53.667
♪ I'll bet you're making
heaven laugh ♪

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:57.834
♪ But it feels
like tears and memories ♪

00:01:57.834 --> 00:02:01.100
♪ Are all ♪

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.100
♪ We have ♪

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:09.701
♪♪

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:12.467
♪ Once I knew it ♪

00:02:12.467 --> 00:02:16.934
♪ I was always a know-it-all ♪

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:20.234
♪ Too busy, too stressed out ♪

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:24.167
♪ To take your call ♪

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:28.234
♪ Thought I would always
find you there ♪

00:02:28.234 --> 00:02:32.400
♪ Sitting in your TV chair ♪

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.334
♪ While time is in a bar ♪

00:02:35.334 --> 00:02:38.334
♪ Having a laugh somewhere ♪

00:02:38.334 --> 00:02:43.734
♪ The nurse said
you were waiting for me ♪

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:52.434
♪ To let go, to let it be ♪

00:02:52.434 --> 00:02:59.934
♪ It's not if, darling,
it's when ♪

00:02:59.934 --> 00:03:08.367
♪ There's always something
left unsaid ♪

00:03:08.367 --> 00:03:12.434
♪ Were your eyes green? ♪

00:03:12.434 --> 00:03:15.667
♪ Were they blue? ♪

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:22.467
♪ What was it
that I forgot to ask you? ♪

00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:31.234
♪ Busy hands,
I'll set 'em down ♪

00:03:31.234 --> 00:03:39.534
♪ To say I love you
here and now ♪

00:03:39.534 --> 00:03:46.601
♪ I'll bet you're making
heaven laugh ♪

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:50.801
♪ But it feels like
tears and memories ♪

00:03:50.801 --> 00:03:54.467
♪ Are all ♪

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:59.734
♪ We have ♪

00:03:59.734 --> 00:04:02.534
♪ Once your girl ♪

00:04:02.534 --> 00:04:11.133
♪ I'm always your girl ♪

00:04:11.133 --> 00:04:13.133
